Agent Q worker connector

Usage: aq-worker [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  template      Build or scan sandbox templates on an explicitly configured build node
  enroll        Enroll this machine. Secrets are read from a prompt or from stdin lines (code, then CF client id and secret with --cf-service-token)
  run           Own node identity, capacity and sandbox lifecycle until stopped
  run-native    Execute one fresh native attempt using an installed qualified executor. Until a concrete production executor is installed, refuses before admission
  sandbox-run   Consume a frozen local handoff. HTTP transport awaits B2/B6a2 wiring
  check-native  Validate native configuration and installed executor without admission
  status        Print the node id and server (never the credential)
